  m_text: 'Drive propels your barge; steer turns it. Follow lit buoys across the
    midnight lake. Something below reacts to moving vessels and physically lifts,
    pulls and strikes their hulls. Slow down and alter course when its wake approaches.
    ACTION rights a capsized barge. Supply Run: physically touch your supply crate
    at the distant platform, then bring it back to the dock slowly. Cooperative Escape
    requires everyone to deliver; it awards participation, not individual winner
    points. Hull damage is visible in the HUD. Rescue near the dock restores integrity.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
